{
	"name": "Brand of the Sightless Eye Stance",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-etched-steel-blade.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With a subtle invocation of magic, you mark a target with a minor magic. Either as a reaction to striking a creature with a weapon on your turn or as a bonus action on your turn, you place your brand on an enemy creature. You gain advantage on insight and perception checks and know where the creature is so long as it is within 15ft, even if it is invisible.</p>",
